  "summary": "The authors’ hypothalamic genotype coefficient compares WT with Ube3a 2x in females. HypoExplorer estimates a common genotype effect across both sexes. The published genotype table is prefrontal cortex: all 12,284 distinct gene IDs pass the authors’ prefrontal filter, and 400 fail their hypothalamic filter. The proposal records `partial / not_comparable`. An offline replay verified all 69 source files and reproduced the audit. [Authors’ contrast definition](https://github.com/IIT-LAND/ube3a_rnaseq/blob/7d0173696f9c0def81886d67a4ed59d620c1e398/utils_final.R#L109-L156)",
